' 13 Verification pipeline: how the sources of every phase go through checks,
' local gates and recipe families to the evidence of the six acceptance
' categories.
'
' Source of Figure V1 in ../verification.md (section 3). The figure restates
' the aggregate gate scripts/check-reified-rspaces-ALL.sh with its eight legs,
' the two gates that it calls, the checker list
' scripts/verify-reified/checker-commands.txt, the cargo suites of the
' phases, and the recipe families RF0 to RF12 of the final gate set, which
' runs them on a development host (decision 137).
' The counts are those of the gate sets of P9 and of P10. It adds no new
' fact.
'
' Reading order, from the left to the right:
'   1. Sources: the code of the phases, the base code, the formal models,
'      the scripts of Z3 and Sage, the maps and policies, the corpora, the
'      examples and the documents.
'   2. Checks: each check reads its sources. The negative controls are
'      checks that must fail.
'   3. Local gates: the aggregate gate and the cargo suites of each phase.
'   4. Recipe families: the same commands, grouped by recipe family. The
'      final gate set runs them on a development host (decision 137).
'   5. Acceptance categories: each recipe step gives evidence for a
'      criterion of one category.
'
' Colors: the shared palette and concept-colors.iuml. The aliases $v_* below
' give the concepts of this figure a color. Each alias names a palette
' variable, so this file holds no hexadecimal color code.
' Render: ./render.sh 13-verification-pipeline.puml   Check: ./render.sh --check

@startuml 13-verification-pipeline
!include ../../../casper/theory/diagrams/palette.iuml
!include concept-colors.iuml

' Concepts of this figure.
' The Rust code of the phases and its tests.
!$v_code = $rrs_substrate
' The code at the base revision and its suites.
!$v_head = $rrs_host
' Formal models: Rocq modules and TLA+ specifications.
!$v_model = $ca_process
' Maps and policies that bind code, models and tests.
!$v_map = $ca_capability
' Corpora of expected outputs, and the examples.
!$v_corpus = $ca_supply
' Documents and diagram sources.
!$v_doc = $ca_surface
' A check that must pass.
!$v_check = $ca_gate
' A negative control: a check that must fail.
!$v_control = $rrs_reject
' A local gate.
!$v_gate = $ca_control
' A recipe family of the final gate set.
!$v_recipe = $ca_pool
' An acceptance category.
!$v_category = $ca_delta

$ca_base_skin()
left to right direction
skinparam ArrowColor $rrs_relation
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam PackageBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam RectangleBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor $ca_note_grey
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 70
title Verification pipeline of all phases: from the sources to the six acceptance categories

package "1. Sources" as SOURCES {
  rectangle SRC_CODE $v_code [
  **Rust code of P1 to P10**
  the substrate of rspace++, the syntax layer
  of models, and reified/ and spaces/ of rholang,
  with their unit tests and suites
  ]
  rectangle SRC_HEAD $v_head [
  **Base code**
  ordinary execution at the base
  revision 4d67b5ccc, and its suites
  ]
  rectangle SRC_ROCQ $v_model [
  **Rocq models**
  formal/rocq/reified_rspaces/theories:
  308 headlines, from EventCorrelation.v
  to Checkpoint.v
  ]
  rectangle SRC_TLA $v_model [
  **TLA+ models**
  formal/tlaplus/reified_rspaces:
  128 configurations with BOUNDS headers
  ]
  rectangle SRC_NUM $v_model [
  **Z3 and Sage**
  formal/z3/reified_rspaces: three scripts
  similarity_metrics.sage and the
  numeric reference vectors
  ]
  rectangle SRC_MAPS $v_map [
  **Maps and policies**
  model maps of the phases, invariant map,
  consensus checklist, footprint, complete
  and closure policies
  ]
  rectangle SRC_CORPUS $v_corpus [
  **Corpora and examples**
  ordinary execution, source normalization,
  the valid and the invalid syntax corpus,
  70 examples of examples/reified_rspaces
  ]
  rectangle SRC_DOCS $v_doc [
  **Documents**
  docs/rspace/reified-rspaces, chapter 21
  and the Reified chapter sections,
  and the diagram sources
  ]
}

package "2. Checks" as CHECKS {
  rectangle CK_ROCQ $v_check [
  **Rocq kernel checks**
  hygiene, coqc -q -noglob alone,
  Print Assumptions closed (308 headlines),
  rocqchk -o: no axiom, no assumption
  ]
  rectangle CK_TLC $v_check [
  **TLC and Apalache**
  exhaustive breadth-first search
  BASE <latex>\mathit{Init} \Rightarrow \mathit{IndInv}</latex>
  STEP <latex>\mathit{IndInv} \land \mathit{Next} \Rightarrow \mathit{IndInv}'</latex>
  ]
  rectangle CK_NUM $v_check [
  **Z3 and Sage checks**
  the squared forms, the selection order
  and the metric algebra; the reference
  vectors, byte for byte
  ]
  rectangle CK_PBT $v_check [
  **Property-based tests**
  one property for each invariant of the
  invariant map, 64 cases with a fixed seed
  ]
  rectangle CK_SUITES $v_check [
  **Deterministic suites**
  the suites of each phase, N1 to N9,
  the examples harness, loom, the bench smoke,
  the base suites, the empty-state hashes
  ]
  rectangle CK_PY $v_check [
  **Python checkers**
  the 48 commands of checker-commands.txt:
  maps, footprint, complete, closure,
  checklist, ledger, patch gate, doc_lint,
  the FIPS matrix, the P0 archive digests
  ]
  rectangle CK_DOC $v_check [
  **Document checks**
  doc_lint.py rules with the citations,
  the snippet and the manifest rules,
  and render.sh --check
  ]
  rectangle NEG $v_control [
  **Negative controls: must fail**
  456 Rocq negative checks and the axiom
  control, the Unsafe TLC configurations,
  the Apalache Error controls, the mutant
  harnesses and the checker self-tests
  ]
}

package "3. Local gates" as GATES {
  rectangle G_ALL $v_gate [
  **scripts/check-reified-rspaces-ALL.sh**
  legs: proofs, tla, z3, sage, checkers,
  examples, loom, benches
  PASS=n FAIL=0 SKIP=0
  ]
  rectangle G_PROOFS $v_gate [
  scripts/check-reified-rspaces-proofs.sh
  ]
  rectangle G_TLA $v_gate [
  scripts/check-reified-rspaces-tla-invariants.sh
  ]
  rectangle G_CARGO $v_gate [
  cargo test ~--release ~-p CRATE ~--test TARGET:
  the suites G2 to G17 of each phase
  ]
}

package "4. Recipe families" as RECIPES {
  rectangle R_FAMILIES $v_recipe [
  **Recipe families RF0 to RF12**
  run on a development host in the final
  gate set (decision 137), one recipe for each leaf
  RF12 runs the aggregate gate
  ]
}

package "5. Acceptance categories" as CATEGORIES {
  rectangle E_MOD $v_category [
  Formally modeled
  ]
  rectangle E_FV $v_category [
  Formal verification passes
  ]
  rectangle E_PBT $v_category [
  Every invariant extracted
  as a property-based test
  ]
  rectangle E_COMPLETE $v_category [
  Implementation complete
  ]
  rectangle E_TESTED $v_category [
  Thoroughly tested
  ]
  rectangle E_DOC $v_category [
  Documented per the
  pgmcp guidelines
  ]
}

SRC_ROCQ -[$rrs_relation]-> CK_ROCQ
SRC_ROCQ -[$rrs_relation]-> NEG
SRC_TLA -[$rrs_relation]-> CK_TLC
SRC_TLA -[$rrs_relation]-> NEG
SRC_NUM -[$rrs_relation]-> CK_NUM
SRC_CODE -[$rrs_relation]-> CK_PBT
SRC_CODE -[$rrs_relation]-> CK_SUITES
SRC_CODE -[$rrs_relation]-> NEG
SRC_HEAD -[$rrs_relation]-> CK_SUITES
SRC_CORPUS -[$rrs_relation]-> CK_SUITES
SRC_CORPUS -[$rrs_relation]-> CK_DOC
SRC_MAPS -[$rrs_relation]-> CK_PY
SRC_DOCS -[$rrs_relation]-> CK_DOC
SRC_DOCS -[$rrs_relation]-> CK_PY

CK_ROCQ -[$rrs_flow]-> G_PROOFS
CK_TLC -[$rrs_flow]-> G_TLA
CK_NUM -[$rrs_flow]-> G_ALL
CK_PBT -[$rrs_flow]-> G_CARGO
CK_SUITES -[$rrs_flow]-> G_CARGO
CK_SUITES -[$rrs_flow]-> G_ALL
CK_PY -[$rrs_flow]-> G_ALL
CK_DOC -[$rrs_flow]-> G_ALL
NEG -[$rrs_fail]-> G_PROOFS
NEG -[$rrs_fail]-> G_TLA
NEG -[$rrs_fail]-> G_ALL
G_PROOFS -[$rrs_flow]-> G_ALL
G_TLA -[$rrs_flow]-> G_ALL

G_ALL -[$rrs_flow]-> R_FAMILIES
G_CARGO -[$rrs_flow]-> R_FAMILIES

R_FAMILIES -[$rrs_effect]-> E_MOD
R_FAMILIES -[$rrs_effect]-> E_FV
R_FAMILIES -[$rrs_effect]-> E_PBT
R_FAMILIES -[$rrs_effect]-> E_COMPLETE
R_FAMILIES -[$rrs_effect]-> E_TESTED
R_FAMILIES -[$rrs_effect]-> E_DOC

legend bottom
**Concept colors**
|<$v_code>     | Rust code of the phases and its tests |
|<$v_head>     | base code and its suites |
|<$v_model>    | formal models (Rocq, TLA+, Z3, Sage) |
|<$v_map>      | maps and policies |
|<$v_corpus>   | corpora of expected outputs, and the examples |
|<$v_doc>      | documents and diagram sources |
|<$v_check>    | check that must pass |
|<$v_control>  | negative control: check that must fail |
|<$v_gate>     | local gate on a development host |
|<$v_recipe>   | recipe family of the final gate set |
|<$v_category> | acceptance category |
**Arrows**
|<$rrs_relation> | the check reads the source |
|<$rrs_flow>     | runs in, or runs the same command as |
|<$rrs_fail>     | the gate requires the expected failure |
|<$rrs_effect>   | the recipe step gives evidence of the category |
endlegend
@enduml
